  "bio": "Eduardo, also known as Edu, is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Pereira, Colombia, who specializes in black & gray style and realism. With a strong international presence, including connections in Alemania and Barcelona, his artistry reflects a deep understanding of shading and intricate designs. Whether you contact him directly or through his pages @kannves, @lebenslaenglichtattoo, or @logiabarcelona, you can expect nothing short of mastery in every piece he creates.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Pereira, Colombia"
